  "abstract": "Install, operate and integrate Arize Phoenix, the open-source LLM tracing, evaluation and prompt playground server. Covers pip, Docker, Compose with PostgreSQL and Helm installs, authentication and API keys, sending OpenInference and raw OTLP traces from Python and TypeScript apps, LiteLLM and vLLM, project routing, content hiding and retention, upgrades with migration limits, and troubleshooting, with a Compose template, a Collector config and a read-only check script.",
